Apple's 20th-anniversary iPhone will be made using the same glass manufacturing process developed for the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-air/">iPhone Air</a>, according to the leaker known as "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/fixed-focus-digital/">Fixed Focus Digital</a>."<br/>
